There is a less obvious Fraunhofer line, designated lower case C, a neutral iron line. 

It is a comparatively boring, typical neutral metal Sun, showing a higher contrast with the spots and plages, a generic blue-Sun image. 
It got onto this list due to legacy reasons, its distinct designation as line Fe (c).
